<a href="/credentials/browse/">Microsoft Credentials</a> in the meantime.',n8=`Your account or connection was flagged for unusual activity. Because of this, we've suspended your access to Microsoft {AppliedSkills}. <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/support/troubleshooting">Learn more</a>.`,o8="Your appeal is being reviewed";var UD="Architecture";var _c="Are you sure?",r8="Deleting your data cannot be undone.",s8="Are you sure you want to leave?";var i8="Article";var a8="a second ago";var l8="Ask the community";var nE="Assessments";var c8="a week ago";var u8='A <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/support/faq?pivots=sandbox">sandbox</a> gives you access to Azure resources. Your Azure subscription will not be charged. The sandbox may only be used to complete training on Microsoft Learn. Use for any other reason is prohibited, and may result in permanent loss of access to the sandbox.',d8="Your appeal has been received. Appeals are reviewed on a first-come, first-served basis, and may take several days to process. If your appeal is approved, you will regain access to this resource.",p8="Assigning roles...",m8="Checking authentication status...",oE="Checking sandbox availability...",g8="Checking module completion status...",f8="Checking for existing sandbox...",h8="Code sent. It may take a while to receive.",b8="Creating file share...",_8="Creating resource group...",y8="Creating storage account...",OD="Deactivating previous sandbox...",v8="Finishing...",x8=`What happened?<br/><br/> We use several methods to prevent misuse of Learn's resources in order to keep it free for everyone. Your account, activity, or connection indicated an elevated risk to our system. Please see our <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/support/troubleshooting" data-bi-name="cloud-shell-troubleshooting-guide">troubleshooting guidance</a> for more information.<br /><br/> The sandbox may only be used to complete training on Learn. Any other use is prohibited by our <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/legal/termsofuse" class="terms-link">Terms of Use</a> and may result in the permanent loss of your access to the sandbox.`,T8="I did not receive a code",w8="Loading current module...",S8="No code received? You can request a new one in {numberOfSeconds} seconds.",HD="Preparing invitation...",E8="You have used all of your sandboxes for today. More sandboxes will be available tomorrow.",C8="Review permissions",A8="We'll send a text to make sure it's you.",k8="Identity verification by phone",BD="You have used {num-used} of {num-limit} sandboxes for today. More sandboxes will be available tomorrow.",I8="Your account could not be verified and we've suspended your access to Learn sandbox.",P8="Account verification failed",L8="Verification code",R8="Verification failed",M8="Verify code",D8="Verifying permissions...",zD="You have used all {num-limit} sandboxes for today. More sandboxes will be available tomorrow.",$8="-- Select Value --",Df="Back";var N8="Beginner";var F8="Remove bookmark for {title}",q8="Add bookmark for {title}";var U8=`Something went wrong with the "{branchFallbackFrom}" branch. We've redirected you to the "{branch}" branch instead.`,O8="Branch selector";var rE="Browse",H8="Browse exams";var na="Browse Certifications",yc="Browse Credentials";var GD="Browse courses";var B8="Browse the full catalog";var z8="Caution";var Be="Cancel";var vc="Certification";var G8="Validate your skills with the latest technology updates and extend your certification by a year, for free.";var V8="Add your personal account",Y8="Add your personal account to this profile",Q8="Your Learn profile is using a work or school account. Certifications belong to you, so they are associated with a personal Microsoft account. You will need to add a personal Microsoft account to this Learn profile in order to connect a certification profile. Your certification data will continue to be associated with your personal account.",j8="No, not now";var W8="Connect your certification profile",K8="Yes, connect this certification profile",J8='This certification profile will be permanently associated with your Learn profile. If you have multiple certification profiles, please merge them first by <a href="https://aka.ms/certhelp">contacting certification support</a>.',Z8="Connecting will allow you to manage your certifications, exams, and appointments directly from your Learn profile.";var X8="We encountered an error with your request. Please try again later. If this issue continues, please contact certification support.";var e9="You have connected your certification profile to your Learn profile. Happy learning!",t9="No certification profile found. Is your certification profile under another personal account?",n9="No certification profile was found for your linked personal Microsoft account {msaEmail}. If you have a certification profile under a different account, you will need to follow the instructions to align the accounts between your certification profile and Learn profile before you can connect.",o9="This certification profile is already connected",r9="The MCID associated with your personal account is already connected with a different Learn profile. If you believe this is incorrect and need help, please contact certification support.",s9="Sorry, you can't connect while merging.",i9="This Learn profile is currently being merged. You can check the progress of the merge process in your account management settings.  Please sign out and sign in again to connect your certification profile.",a9="Read instructions to align accounts";var l9="We found a certification profile for your personal account";var c9="Learn more about renewing",u9='If you need accessibility accommodation, please see our <a class="text-decoration-underline font-weight-semibold" href="#url">Accommodations Information</a>.',sE="Already have this certification?",d9="This certification is not yet eligible for renewal.",p9="Certification req