e to register for this challenge before it starts. Once enabled, you will not be able to disable or edit certain details of your challenge.",r7="After enabling early registration you can no longer edit most details of your challenge, including the collection modules and the start date. <strong>Once early registration is enabled it cannot be reversed.</strong>",Of="Start date",Hf="Start time",Bf="End date",zf="End time";var c$="I understand",s7="Sorry, this challenge is private.",i7="This challenge is not visible to other users.",a7="You can review your challenges in your user profile.",l7="View your challenges",c7="Go to leaderboard",u7="Completions",rv="Copy Challenge",d7="You are about to copy this challenge. The new challenge will have the same details and content. Once created, you will be able to edit it via its details page.",p7="Delete challenge",m7="Start date must be in the future.",g7="End date must be after the start date or the current date.",f7="Please select a valid primary subject matter.",h7="Please enter a valid target name.",b7="Please enter a valid ID associated with the selected audience of this challenge.",_7="Please enter a valid purpose for this challenge.",y7="You are not allowed to perform this action.",v7="By taking or creating a Microsoft Learn challenge, you\u2019ll advance your technical skills, get yourself and your organization project-ready, and learn how to implement complex technical solutions.",x7='How it <span class="gradient-text-vivid">works</span>',T7="Register and complete all content within the timeframe",w7="All challenges require participants to have an active Microsoft Learn profile. Be sure to complete the challenge within the allotted timeframe.",S7="Celebrate and showcase your new skills",E7="Share your achievements with your professional network by adding new Microsoft skills to your LinkedIn profile.",C7="Find your next challenge and level up with a Microsoft Credential",A7="Take more challenges to gain even more in-d