hallenge's collection has been deleted due to a violation of our <a href="/legal/termsofuse">Terms of Use</a>. These were manually reported or identified through automated detection before action was taken. Please refer to our <a href="/legal/termsofuse">Terms of Use</a> for more information.`,u$=`If this challenge's title or description has been deleted, please go to <a href="{detailPageLink}">its detail page</a> to update.`,CE=`If a section title or description of this challenge's collection has been deleted, please go to the <a href="{collectionPageLink}">collection</a> to update.`,pY="If this challenge's title or description has been deleted, you can update it above.";var mY="You will continue to see this alert until an update has been made.",gY='This challenge was either removed or is currently unavailable. Please try again later or <a href="{url}">visit your challenges.</a>';var fY="Ask Learn",hY="Describe what you'd like to do",bY="The chat has been reset",AE=`I've stopped generating the response. Want to try something else? Try our prompt guide by selecting the "View prompts" button.`,_Y="AI-generated content may be incorrect",yY="Accurate/relevant content",vY="Complete/clear content",xY="Fast response",TY="Inaccurate/irrelevant content",wY="Incomplete/unclear content",SY="Offensive/inappropriate content",EY="Slow response",d$="Something else",CY="Thanks for your feedback.",p$=`Sorry, I can't chat about this. Please enter another topic or try the prompt guide by selecting the "View prompts" button below.`,AY="Not now",kY="Meet our AI assistant, Ask Learn",kE="Ask Learn is an AI assistant that can answer questions, clarify concepts, and define terms using trusted Microsoft documentation.",IY="Check for accuracy",PY="Ask Learn is in preview. Please check responses as AI-generated content may be inaccurate. Use the feedback buttons to help us improve the experience.",LY='Please read the <a class="text-decoration-underline" data-bi-name="02-link" data-bi-an="fre