 associated to an organization ({email}). By becoming a member, <strong>you understand and acknowledge</strong> that your Microsoft Learn membership means our network of sites and applications will record, and track your achievements and activities and we may share your results and activities with your organization. Additionally, your username, display name, profile picture, affiliation, achievements and activities will be publicly visible. You can hide your achievements and activities under settings.<br/><br/>After you create your profile, we recommend you link a personal account so that you can access your learning progress regardless of your employment status. You can link additional accounts in the Account Management section of the profile settings.";var ioe="Microsoft Learn will send email to you at the email you provide below.";var Kf="Microsoft Privacy Notice",aoe="You need to agree with the Microsoft Privacy Notice to keep your profile and relating data.";var loe="Miles";var Jf="{numberOfMinutes} min";var $u="{numberOfMinutes} mins",B$="Minute",um="Minutes";var coe="{duration} minutes ago";var Fo="Module",uoe="Module assessment",doe="The questions and answer choices in this module assessment were generated using AI and reviewed by a human author.",poe="AI-generated content";var moe="Provide feedback",goe="Give as many details as you can, but don't include any private or sensitive information",foe="Privacy Statement",hoe="Provide feedback about AI-generated content",boe="Your feedback will be used to improve Microsoft products and services.",_oe="Content errors",yoe="Design and usability errors",voe="Other errors",xoe="Scoring errors",Toe="Is this content helpful to you?";var woe="Assess your understanding of this module. Sign in and answer all questions correctly to earn a pass designation on your profile.";var Soe="Collapse learning object {objectiveId}",Eoe="Try again",Coe="Module assessment hash: {hash}";var Aoe="no AI generated questions found for this module assessment in locale {locale}, branch {branch}.",z$="Great job! You passed the module assessment.",G$="Achieve a score of {passingCriteria}% or higher to pass. Click \u201CRetake\u201D to try again, or \u201CNext\u201D to finish the module. You can retake the module assessment at any time.";var _0="Module assessment passed",koe="All module assessments passed",Ioe="Question ID: {questionId}",Poe="This assessment evaluates your understanding of the module. Unlike before, you won't get feedback on individual answers\u2014just whether they're right or wrong. This is meant to measure what you've learned. Take time to review the module materials before starting.",Loe="<empty>";var y0="Retake",Roe="Your progress has been saved.",Moe="to save progress.",Doe="Score";var $oe="Sign-in successful",Noe="Review mode",Foe="Learning objective",qoe="Rationale",Uoe="Take the module assessment",Ooe="Marked to be hidden",V$="Hidden to users",Y$="Visible to users",Hoe="Marked to be visible",Zf="Regenerate AI Content",v0="Login GitHub to Regen Or Hide Questions",Q$="Moderation functions are not available for you. Please make sure:you have the push permission to the repository {repoName}, and you have authorized Microsoft Docs during GitHub single sign-on.",Boe="Please login GitHub and authorize to enable your moderation functions in review mode.",zoe="\u2018Update question visibility\u2019 button:\u201CYou can use this function to hide poor questions from users. First, select the questions, then update their visibility. Note that each learning objective requires at least 3 good questions.",Goe="\u2018Regenerate AI Content\u2019 button:\u201CYou can use this function to regenerate all content for this module assessment, including learning objectives and questions. If any learning objective has fewer than 3 good questions, you need to run this function. Note that after regeneration, feedback will persist if you have filled out and submitted the form, but marking a question to hide will not persist.",j$="Continue on GitHub",Voe="To update question visibility, we will need to make changes to the file in GitHub on your behalf. Please click 'Continue on GitHub' to process the change and check the build status on GitHub.",Yoe="No enough remaining questions for learning objective {index}. Click 'OK' to go back to re-select.",Qoe="To trigger the regeneration process, we will need to make changes to the file in GitHub on your behalf. Please click 'Continue on GitHub' to proceed the change and check the build status on GitHub.",Xf="Update question visibility",joe="Login failed on GitHub. Please retry.",Woe="Github File Not Found. Please retry.",Koe="Can't fetch the file from GitHub. Please retry.",Joe="You don't have writer permission on this repo:{repoName}.";var W$="{count} module",K$="{count} modules",Zoe="Module incomplete",Xoe="This module helps prepare you for {exam}.",ere="{platformName} Module Reference",Sv="This module requires a sandbox to complete.",eh="Modules",tre="Modules in this learning path",nre="You have been redirected to the newest product version available for this page.";var ore="{duration} months ago";var Ev="More";var Ei="Next",rre="Next learning path:";var sre="Next module:";var ire="Next unit",Vs="No",are="New collection";var lre="No current courses available for this certification";var cre='No items in this section. Move items here from other sections or add items from the <a href="{link}">Learn training browse page</a>.';var ure="Learning paths or modules are not yet available for this",dre="none";var pre="No output";var Ys="No results",Qs="No results found";var mre="No suggestions";var gre="No, thanks",fre="Note";var hre="Very satisfied",bre="Satisfied",_re="Neither satisfied nor dissatisfied",yre="Dissatisfied",vre="Very Dissatisfied";var To="OK",xre="OK, got it.";var Tre="Please edit your interests";var wre="We don't currently have anything that fits your selections.",Sre="1 Module",Ere="1 Unit";var Cre="Open search";var Are="{productName} feedback",kre="{productName} is an open source project. Select a link to provide feedback:";var Ire='I will receive information via email related to my use of Microsoft Learn. To learn more about how Microsoft handles your personal data please visit the <a href="https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=521839">Microsoft Privacy Statement.</a>',Pre="I would like to receive information via email related to my use of Microsoft Learn. To learn more about how Microsoft handles your personal data please visit the Microsoft Privacy Statement.",Lre='I would like to receive information via email related to my use of Microsoft Learn. To learn more about how Microsoft handles your personal data please visit the <a href="https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=521839">Microsoft Privacy Statement.</a>',Rre="I would like to receive information via email related to my use of Microsoft Learn. To learn more about how Microsoft handles your personal data please visit the Microsoft Privacy Statement.",Mre='I would like to receive information via email related to my use of Microsoft Learn. To learn more about how Microsoft handles your personal data please visit the <a href="https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=521839">Microsoft Privacy Statement.</a>',Dre='Participation requires transferring your personal data to other countries in which Microsoft operates, including the United States. By submitting this form, you agree to the transfer of your data outside of China. <a href="https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=521839">Privacy Statement.</a>',J$="I agree to receiving marketing information and use of my personal information for marketing purposes (required):",$re='<div class="content"><ul><li><span class="font-weight-bold font-size-lg">Consent to Receive Marketing</span>: The information collected may be used for Microsoft to send you information, tips, and offers about Microsoft Learn and other Microsoft products and services. </li><li> Items of Personal Information to be Collected: First Name, Last Name, Email Address, Phone Number, Company name and size, Job Title, Country/Region of residence, and any other fields visible on this form. </li><li>Purpose of Collection and Use: <span class="font-weight-bold font-size-lg">To contact you for marketing purposes </span></li><li> Retention/Use Period of Personal Information: <span class="font-weight-bold font-size-lg">As long as needed to provide the service(s) you are requesting </span></li></ul></div> You have the right to refuse the collection and use of personal information for marketing purposes, and receiving marketing information as set forth above. However, if you refuse, you may not be able to receive the benefits described under Purpose of Collection & Use. <a href="https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?LinkId=521839">Privacy Statement.</a>';var th="Select a country/region",Nre="Select a country code";var Fre="Open Cloud Shell",qre="Optional";var x0="{label} (optional)";var Ure="or";var T0="Other",Ore="Output";var Hre="Overall, how satisfied or dissatisfied are you with Microsoft Learn?";var Bre="Overview",zre="Overview for: {title}";var w0="Package",Z$="{platformName} Package Reference";var S0="Page {pageNumber} of {numberOfPages}";var Gre="pagination";var Cv="Past {numberOfDays} days";var Vre="Phone number",nh="Plan";var Yre="Please fill out this field.",Av="Please provide an email address.",Qre="Please provide feedback on how we can improve this content. If applicable, provide the first part of the sentence or string at issue.";var jre="Print",Wre="Print is disabled for content requiring authorization.",E0="Privacy policy",Kre="Poor",Jre="We're sorry. The lab environment needed to complete the exercises in this unit is temporarily unavailable.",C0="Launch lab",Zre="Loading lab...",Xre="Lab is complete",ese="We'll take you to where you left off.",X$="This unit includes a lab to complete.",eN="Use the free resources provided in the lab to complete the exercises in this uni