u can continue to access Microsoft Learn's training content. Many module exercises can be completed using your personal subscription, but charges may apply, and you may need to modify the instructions to work with your subscription.`,oie="Oops, there was an issue getting your environment ready. Please refresh the page and try again.",rie="All Microsoft Learn sandboxes are currently in use. Please wait 5-10 minutes and try again.",dN="Please note that the Jupyter Notebook Sandbox only supports English language at this time.",sie="Launch the {product} sandbox and use the instructions on this page to complete the activity.",iie="Microsoft Learn needs your permission to create {product} resources.";var aie="Open sandbox in new window",lie="Password:",cie="Please login to the portal using the following credentials:",uie=`Sandboxes are no longer available. To complete the exercises, you'll need access to an Azure subscription. If you don't have one yet, you can <a href="https://azure.microsoft.com/pricing/purchase-options/azure-account?cid=msft_learn">sign up</a> for a free 30-day Azure trial or a pay-as-you-go subscription.`,die="Username:",pie="Sandbox activated! Time remaining:";var mie="Sandbox Duration",gie="All data is removed when time runs out. Afterward, you'll be able to create a fresh sandbox.";var fie="Looks like your login has expired. Please sign in to activate the sandbox.";var hie='For more information, please check the <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/support/troubleshooting">troubleshooting guidance page</a>.',lt="Save";var sh="Save successful.",bie="Score:",_ie="Skill";var pN="Add to plan",mN="Added to Plans",yie="Manage {title} in Plans",vie="Add {title} to a plan";var gN="Copy plan";var xie="Milestone {number}",Tie='Added to <a href="{url}" class="has-text-tertiary-invert text-decoration-underline">{collectionName}</a>',wie='Added to <a href="{url}" class="has-text-tertiary-invert text-decoration-underline">Plans</a>';var Sie='Removed from <a href="{url}" class="has-text-tertiary-invert text-decoration-underline">{collectionName}</a>',Eie='Removed from <a href="{url}" class="has-text-tertiary-invert text-decoration-underline">Plans</a>';var Cie='<a href="{url}" class="has-text-tertiary-invert text-decoration-underline">Plans</a> updated',Aie='How it <span class="gradient-text-vivid">works</span>',kie="Start a plan",Iie="Get started with your new structured learning journey.",Pie="Go through milestones",Lie="Choose to go through milestones in the recommended time or at your own pace.",Rie="Achieve learning outcomes",Mie="Gain the skills you need to advance your career or accomplish project-based goals.",Die="Choose a different name for your plan",$ie="Copy Link",Nie="Congrats on completing the {title} plan!",Fie="You put in the time to learn something new, let your network share in your victory!";var R0="Manage";var M0="Leave",qie="Leave plan",Uie="Are you sure you want to leave this plan?",Oie="You'll lose all records of your progress, and won't appear in the creator's report.",Hie="Yes, leave",Bie="Enter a title",zie="Oops, we couldn't find that plan =]",Gie="We looked everywhere. But don't worry, you can review a history of your plan activity in your user profile.",Vie="View your plan history",Yie="1 milestone in this plan",Qie="{numberOfMilestones} milestones in this plan",jie="Sorry, this plan is private.",Wie="The creator of this plan has marked it as private and it is not currently visible to other users.",Kie="You can review your Plans in your user profile.",Jie="View your Plans",Zie='You can also return to <a href="{url}" class="color-text text-decoration-underline">Plans</a>.',Xie="Plan unavailable",eae="This plan does not exist or was removed.",tae="If this link was shared with you, request a new link.",nae="Completed";var oae="A plan allows learners to progress through a set of milestones to achieve learning outcomes. You can invite learners to your plan and track their progress.",rae="Started";var sae="Official plan";var iae="Plan not found. Please refresh the page.",aae="One or more milestones is empty or is missing the recommended days to complete. Please fix these issues before publishing the plan.",lae="Plan details";var cae="Delete plan",uae="To delete your plan, ensure no users are joined to it. All users must drop the plan first.",dae="Are you sure that you want to delete the following plan?",pae="Yes, delete plan";var ih="Invite learners",fN="Copy invite link",mae="Link copied to clipboard",gae="Delete learning group",fae="You are about to delete the following learning group: <strong>{learningGroupName}</strong>. Do you want to proceed?",hae="Group deleted",bae="Groups",kv="Group name",_ae="Individuals";var yae="A learning group is a name that allows you to identify a group of learners in your progress report; learners will not see this name.<br/><br/>Creating a learning group generates a unique link to your plan for the specific group of learners.";var hN="New learning group",vae="Please enter a name for this learning group",xae="Your invitation to start {planTitle} plan on Microsoft Learn",Tae="Start your plan and begin your learning journey today.",wae="You have been invited to start the {planTitle} plan on Microsoft Learn.",Sae="A plan is a set of curated and organized content on Microsoft Learn with milestones designed to help you to achieve learning outcomes.",Eae="By completing this plan, you\u2019ll achieve the following learning outcomes:",Cae="Start your plan today!",ah="View progress",Aae="Download this file to view a list of learners and their progress.",Iv="Download CSV",kae="The file contains the following information:",Iae="Learner group",Pae="Learn username",Lae="Start date",Rae="End date",Mae="Items completed",Dae="Items total",D0="Learning outcomes",$ae="Edit learning outcomes",Nae="A learning outcome is specific knowledge, skills, or expertise that the learner will get from completing this plan.",Fae="Tip: Begin each learning outcome with a verb. Each outcome should finish the sentence \u201CUpon completion of this plan, learners will be able to...\u201D";var qae="Outcome 1",Uae="Outcome 2 (optional)",Oae="Outcome 3 (optional)",Hae="Outcome {number}",Bae="Convert to an official plan",zae="Convert a plan to an official plan",Gae="An official plan should be used when you want your plan to <strong>represent Microsoft</strong> and if you would like to include links that are external to Microsoft Learn. Always ensure that your plan is complete, free of typographical errors, and that content is in the correct sequence. <strong>Once an official plan is published, it cannot be altered.</strong>",Vae="To preserve any external links from an underlying Official Collection or plan, please convert to an official plan.",Yae="An official plan represents Microsoft, so please ensure that your published plan is complete, free of typographical errors, and that content is in the correct sequence.";var $0="This plan has been submitted to be localized",Qae="The plan is complete and proofread",jae="Thank you for submitting your official plan for localization.",Wae="Mark as completed",N0="Milestone",Kae="Add milestone",Jae="Edit milestone";var Zae="New milestone",Xae="Days to milestone:",ele="1 milestone",tle="{numberOfMilestones} milestones",nle="Milestones in this plan";var ole="Milestone completed";var rle="Move to";var sle="Please confirm all milestones have a title and days to complete. You may need to expand each milestone.",ile="Unsaved changes",ale="You have unsaved changes that may be lost if you exit now. To preserve your work, please click 'Cancel', then go back and save your changes.",lle="Close without saving";var cle="Your changes will not be applied until you click the <strong>Save</strong> button.";var ule="Mark as complete?",dle="Do you want to mark it complete? Once you mark it as complete, you won't be able to review it again.",ple="Welcome!",mle="To start this plan, you have to share your plan progress data with the creator of the plan. The data that will be shared is: the dates that you start and complete the plan and how many items of the total you have completed at any point in time. Your data will be associated with your public Learn username.",gle="Do you agree to share your progress?",fle="Yes, I agree to share my progress",hle="If you would like to receive useful emails to guide and encourage you through your Plans journey, please go to your Profile Settings page and provide a contact email for notifications.",ble="Save all items in this plan as a new",_le="Please sign in to add this to your plan.";var yle="You don't have any plans yet.",bN="A learner group with this name exists already. Please enter a different name",vle="Violation detected",xle='Some text in this plan (title, description of the plan, milestone titles or description of milestones, or the learning outcomes) violates our <a href="/legal/termsofuse">Terms of Use</a> and have been deleted. If you have not yet published the plan, you can provide updated text in compliance with our <a href="/legal/termsofuse">Terms of Use</a> before publishing this plan.',Tle="You will continue to see this alert until you made an update to your unpublished plan. If your plan is already published, you cannot make any updates.",wle="Reported plan",Sle='A concern has been reported on this plan and it is currently under Microsoft review. Please refer to our <a href="/legal/termsofuse">Terms of Use</a> for more information.';var F0='Success! Your plan has been saved to your <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/users/me/activity/">profile</a>.';var _N="Redeem your code now.",Ele="We could not copy your code at this time. Please try again.",Cle="We could not copy your URL at this time. Please try again.",Ale="It looks like you have already redeemed this code.<br/>Go to your achievements page to view your achievements.",kle="You have hit your limit of 300 codes requested per day. Please try again 