d you personalized recommendations, helpful tips, or Q&A notifications.",_ue="You'll get notifications at {email}.",yue="Your email is not currently set to receive notifications and will not be enrolled after the merge.",vue='<a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/training/support/faq?pivots=profile">Learn more</a> about merging profiles.',xue="This profile has been locked",Tue="This profile is currently locked and is being merged with another profile. Please sign-in to a different profile.",MN="Retry merge",DN="Terminate merge",wue="Here's what will happen",Sue="Merge complete",Eue="Profile 1",Cue="Profile 2",Aue="You can refresh the page to check the merge status.",kue="Profile merge record not found",Iue='Unable to find your profile merge. Please refresh the page. If the problem is still there, please contact <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/training/support/troubleshooting#report-feedback">customer support</a>.',Pue="A previous merge attempt is preventing this action",Lue="One of the profiles you are trying to merge is currently being merged with another profile. Please log into both profiles to check the status.",Rue="You're combining two Microsoft Learn profiles.",Mue="Would you like to combine your learning data into one profile?",Due="Merging your data is permanent and cannot be undone, but all your learning progress including achievements, skills, and certifications will be combined in one place.",$ue="Your profiles have been successfully merged.",Nue="We ran into a problem merging your source profile (username: {sourceUser}) to your destination profile (username: {destinationUser}).",Fue="Some of your data might have been merged in the process, so it is expected if you find some data disappearing from your source profile and appearing on your destination profile.",que="You can choose one of the following actions:",Uue="<b>{terminateMergeText}</b>: It will stop and quit the merge process. You will be able to use both profiles as usual and can trigger a ne